# Database URL — PostgreSQL (Supabase, Neon, Render Postgres, or self-hosted)
#
# IMPORTANT for Supabase + Render/Vercel/etc.:
# Use the POOLER connection string (port 6543), NOT the direct connection (port 5432).
# The direct connection often fails on cloud hosts due to IPv6/IPv4 issues.
#
# Get the pooler URL from: Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → Database →
# Connection string → "Transaction" mode (port 6543).
#
# The username format is "postgres.PROJECT_REF" (e.g. postgres.abcdefghij).
# Add ?pgbouncer=true&connection_limit=1 for Prisma compatibility.
#
# Example (Supabase pooler):
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.YOUR_PROJECT_REF:YOUR_PASSWORD@aws-0-region.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true&connection_limit=1

# ───────── Optional: SMTP email (for reply-to-customer feature) ─────────
# Configure these in the admin panel (Email module) OR set them here.
# When set here, they override the DB values.
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false
# SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=your-app-password
# SMTP_FROM_EMAIL=your-email@gmail.com
# SMTP_FROM_NAME=Gadget Doctor East Kilbride

# ───────── Next.js ─────────
# NextAuth secret (if you enable NextAuth later)
# NEXTAUTH_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string
# NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ───────── Firebase Analytics (pre-configured for gadgetdoctorls project) ─────────
# These are public client-side values (Firebase config is not secret).
# Already wired with the gadgetdoctorls project defaults in src/lib/firebase.ts.
# Override here if you want to use a different Firebase project.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyDIN10b4rZnk1hKdO45fHBsuSuaVgBCDEI
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=gadgetdoctorls.firebaseapp.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=gadgetdoctorls
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=gadgetdoctorls.firebasestorage.app
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=100649969605
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:100649969605:web:d9606afdda50350f6e8dac
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-5EGH3VDTST
